sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant AUTH as Auth Service
    participant ACCT as Account Service
    participant K as Kafka

    U->>F: Submit registration (email, password)
    F->>GW: POST /auth/register
    GW->>AUTH: POST /auth/register
    AUTH->>AUTH: Validate email/password strength
    AUTH->>AUTH: Check user exists (private DB)
    AUTH->>AUTH: Hash password (Argon2id)
    AUTH->>AUTH: Create user (private DB)
    AUTH->>ACCT: (optional sync) Create account request or emit event
    AUTH-->>K: emit auth.user.created (optional)
    ACCT-->>K: emit account.created
    AUTH->>AUTH: Issue JWT access/refresh (refresh hashed)
    GW-->>F: Return account_id, tokens
    F-->>U: Success + auto-login
